    "language": "In our final scenario,[0] we will say that our right striker is the one who is open. In this scenario, because you receive the ball, we would look at the top attackers. We will see which one is most open in this scenario. This, this striker's most open, and we will pass to him. [1]This way, we can progress up the field as fast as possible. It's very important[2] to be efficient with your passing and not waste time. Time is very important for when you wanna attack. Time, if you can beat the other tea- the other opponents, uh, timewise, and you're more efficient on getting up the field, you'll be able to get into better scoring positions.",
